<main id="associations">
    <section>
      <h1>Professional Associations</h1>
      <p>Here are some organizations I am involved in or plan to join, which support my growth as a computer science student and aspiring software engineer.</p>
    </section>
  
    <section class="association-list">
      <article class="association">
        <h2>CodePath</h2>
        <p>CodePath is a nonprofit that partners with colleges to offer industry-informed tech courses and career support, especially for underrepresented students in tech.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.codepath.org/" target="_blank">Visit CodePath</a>
      </article>
  
      <article class="association">
        <h2>Science Olympiad Alumni Network</h2>
        <p>Science Olympiad promotes STEM education through rigorous academic competitions. As an alumna, I continue to engage with the community and support younger students.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.soinc.org/" target="_blank">Visit Science Olympiad</a>
      </article>
  
      <article class="association">
        <h2>Drexel Women in Computing Society (WiCS)</h2>
        <p>WiCS supports and empowers women in tech through mentorship, networking events, and workshops. I'm looking forward to contributing to this vibrant Drexel community.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://drexel.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/women-in-computing-society" target="_blank">Visit Drexel WiCS</a>
      </article>
  
      <article class="association">
        <h2>Drexel CyberDragons</h2>
        <p>CyberDragons is Drexel’s cybersecurity team, where students compete in Capture The Flag events and sharpen skills in security, networking, and ethical hacking.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://drexel.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/cyberdragons" target="_blank">Visit CyberDragons</a>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>